---
layout: layouts/base.liquid
permalink: /our-process.html
nav: process
title: "Our Process — Ridgewood Wealth Management"
description: "Our roadmap to creating, preserving, and transferring wealth: discovery, strategy, implementation, and communication."
scripts:
  - assets/js/cycle.js
---
<main id="main">
	<section class="page-hero process-hero wrap grid" aria-labelledby="page-title">
		<p class="label accent">Discover • Strategize • Implement • Communicate</p>
		<h1 id="page-title" class="title-xl">Our <em>Process</em></h1>
		<div class="process-hero-intro span-5">
			<p class="lede">
				We understand that financial planning and management is an ongoing process, that’s why we’ve developed
				this roadmap to creating, preserving, and transferring wealth:
			</p>
			<div class="process-hero-controls">
				<button class="button carousel-next" type="button" aria-controls="process-cycle" hidden>
					Next step
				</button>
				<button
					class="button button-ghost carousel-toggle"
					type="button"
					aria-controls="process-cycle"
					aria-label="Pause"
					hidden
				></button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- The roadmap is a continual loop: the steps ride a circular track
		     clockwise; the active step sits at 12 o'clock with the next one
		     peeking in at 9. assets/js/cycle.js advances it. Without JS,
		     Discover shows and the button stays hidden. -->
		<div class="carousel span-7 start-6" id="process-cycle" data-carousel>
			<div class="carousel-stage">
				<span class="carousel-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="carousel-arrow carousel-arrow-in" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<span class="carousel-arrow carousel-arrow-out" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				<ol aria-label="The roadmap, a continual cycle">
					<li class="carousel-slot" style="--i: 0" data-pos="0">
						<div class="carousel-face">
							<p class="meta accent">01 / 04</p>
							<h2 class="carousel-name"><a href="#discover">Discover</a></h2>
							<p class="carousel-tag">Getting to Know You</p>
							<p class="carousel-text">We put in the time and effort to understand you and your goals.</p>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li class="carousel-slot" style="--i: 1" data-pos="3" inert>
						<div class="carousel-face">
							<p class="meta accent">02 / 04</p>
							<h2 class="carousel-name"><a href="#strategize">Strategize</a></h2>
							<p class="carousel-tag">Making the Plan</p>
							<p class="carousel-text">
								We use the knowledge gained in discovery to craft the best plan to achieve your goals.
							</p>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li class="carousel-slot" style="--i: 2" data-pos="2" inert>
						<div class="carousel-face">
							<p class="meta accent">03 / 04</p>
							<h2 class="carousel-name"><a href="#implement">Implement</a></h2>
							<p class="carousel-tag">Working the Plan</p>
							<p class="carousel-text">
								We carry out the plan in a way that accommodates your needs, and accomplishes your goals.
							</p>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li class="carousel-slot" style="--i: 3" data-pos="1" inert>
						<div class="carousel-face">
							<p class="meta accent">04 / 04</p>
							<h2 class="carousel-name"><a href="#communicate">Communicate</a></h2>
							<p class="carousel-tag">Staying in touch</p>
							<p class="carousel-text">We meet regularly to keep you informed, and get your input.</p>
						</div>
					</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
			<p class="carousel-status visually-hidden" role="status"></p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Discover -->
	<section class="section wrap" id="discover" aria-labelledby="discover-title">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="meta accent">Step 1</span>
			<span class="label">Getting to Know You</span>
		</div>
		<div class="grid">
			<h2 id="discover-title" class="title-l">Discover</h2>
			<ol class="numbered span-8 start-5">
				<li>
					We complete a thorough analysis of your finances (bank statements, investment accounts, mortgage,
					loans/debt, cash flow, etc).
				</li>
				<li>
					We then go beyond the facts and figures to understand what motivates your personal, professional, and
					financial decisions and planning.
				</li>
				<li>
					We evaluate your tolerance for risk and your reaction to various market scenarios to ensure your
					investment strategy is true to you.
				</li>
				<li>We conduct an estate analysis to ensure there are no blind spots in your current estate plan.</li>
			</ol>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Strategize -->
	<section class="section wrap" id="strategize" aria-labelledby="strategize-title">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="meta accent">Step 2</span>
			<span class="label">Making the Plan</span>
		</div>
		<h2 id="strategize-title" class="title-l">Strategize</h2>

		<div class="figs figs-3 mt-l">
			<article class="fig fig-short">
				<div class="stage-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="is-on"></span><span></span><span></span></div>
				<h3 class="fig-heading">For those <em>saving for retirement</em></h3>
				<p class="fig-body">
					We create an overall financial plan that includes savings strategies, tax efficiency, cash flow, asset
					growth, benefits optimization, and charitable giving (if applicable).
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="fig fig-short">
				<div class="stage-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span class="is-on"></span><span></span></div>
				<h3 class="fig-heading">For those <em>approaching retirement</em></h3>
				<p class="fig-body">
					You are nearing the finish line. Your strategy needs to take into consideration the impact of the market
					over the next few years as well as the rest of your life. We create a financial plan taking advantage of
					IRS allowed maximum savings opportunities, pre-retiree protection strategies, debt reduction, and
					addressing other risks to your retirement to ensure you stick the landing when that time comes.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="fig fig-short">
				<div class="stage-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span class="is-on"></span></div>
				<h3 class="fig-heading">For those <em>in retirement</em></h3>
				<p class="fig-body">
					The rules have changed for you… so should your investment strategy. We craft personal income and
					investment strategies to address your fundamental expense needs, your discretionary spending, and any
					legacy/estate planning needs you may have for future generations.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Implement -->
	<section class="section wrap" id="implement" aria-labelledby="implement-title">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="meta accent">Step 3</span>
			<span class="label">Working the Plan</span>
		</div>
		<div class="grid">
			<h2 id="implement-title" class="title-l">Implement</h2>
			<div class="span-8 start-5">
				<p class="prose">
					Once we know you and have developed a plan customized to you, we implement your financial plan and
					investment strategy.
				</p>
				<p class="statement mt-m">
					This is the step in the process where we take your vision for the future and take the steps necessary to
					<em>make that vision a reality.</em>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Communicate -->
	<section class="section wrap" id="communicate" aria-labelledby="communicate-title">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="meta accent">Step 4</span>
			<span class="label">Staying in touch</span>
		</div>
		<div class="grid">
			<h2 id="communicate-title" class="title-l">Communicate</h2>
			<div class="cadence span-4 start-5">
				<p class="meta accent">Regularly</p>
				<p>
					We meet regularly to review your plan and adapt it to accommodate developments in your life and changes
					in the markets.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cadence span-4">
				<p class="meta accent">Annually</p>
				<p>
					We also hold an annual meeting to review the overall financial plan and evaluate progress toward your
					financial goals.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</main>
